### 0 cli render trip.wtf --format text
$ wtf render trip.wtf --format text --root <root> --now 2026-09-16T14:00:00-04:00
exit 0
--- stdout
# New York | Oaxaca

## Friday, November 20, 2026 · New York | Oaxaca 5 stops · 07:04 AM – 07:20 PM · in 65 days

07:04 AM    🛫 Depart JFK for MEX on AM 405 → 4h 51m until Arrive at MEX
        Reservation Number: LPSNKQ
        Seats: 22B, 22C
Note: Flight duration is 5h 51m. 1 free carry on.

11:55 AM    🛬 Arrive at MEX ↻ 2h 50m layover
        Note: 2h 50m layover.

2:45 PM    🛫 Depart MEX for OAX on AM 1050 → 3h 15m until Check in to Majagua Hotel

06:00 PM    🛏️ Check in to Majagua Hotel → 1h 20m until Dinner at Levadura de Olla
Address: 523 Calle de José María Pino Suárez, Centro, Oaxaca, Mexico, 68000
        Confirmation Number: EXP-2550163618

07:20 PM    🍽️ 🌟Dinner at Levadura de Olla cancel by Thu Nov 19, 07:20 PM
        Cancel by: 24h before
        Note: Chef's tasting menu.

SATURDAY, NOVEMBER 21  OAXACA 2 stops · 11:30 AM – 01:00 PM · in 66 days

11:30 AM    🔍🗺️ Explore Oaxaca → 1h 30m until Grab food at Mercado 20 Noviembre
Museum of Cultures of Oaxaca
Zocalo

01:00 PM    🍽️ Grab food at Mercado 20 Noviembre

