-- applied to trip.wtf (version 2)
# New York | Oaxaca

## Friday, November 20, 2026 · New York | Oaxaca

07:04 AM  > Depart JFK for MEX on AM 405
    Reservation Number: LPSNKQ
    Seats: 22B, 22C
    Note: Flight duration is 5h 51m. 1 free carry on.

11:55 AM  < Arrive at MEX
